.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-list 1  "oct-list " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-list \- Enumerate available OpenPGP cards
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct list\fR [\fB\-i\fR|\fB\-\-idents\-only\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Enumerate available OpenPGP cards
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-i\fR, \fB\-\-idents\-only\fR
Only show card idents
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
